      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To initiate the computer repair process, begin by examining the hardware."
      ],
      "justification": "The start node and two action nodes together paraphrase the opening unit. Splitting initiation and examination preserves the behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the hardware has been checked, proceed with repairing any issues that were identified."
      ],
      "justification": "Splits the unit into identification and repair steps. This re-typing/splitting does not change the process behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the necessary repairs have been made, conclude the hardware inspection."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly matches the conclusion step after the first round of repairs."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Following the completion of the repair process, it is important to test the functionality of the system."
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately captures the testing step described in the source."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the test results indicate that everything is functioning properly, then the hardware inspection process can be concluded."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the XOR gateway, the positive condition guard, the concluding action, and the endpoint for this successful path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n11",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the test results indicate that there are still issues, then further hardware repairs are required."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the negative branch guard and the subsequent repair action required by the text."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once these additional repairs have been made, the hardware inspection process can be concluded."
      ],
      "justification": "Matches the final conclusion action and the second endpoint after the retry loop."
    }
